data: {"id": "e37ddc757c53442c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1194", "run_id": "e37ddc757c53442c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=401 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 2 completed, 1 in progress, 2 pending\n[ ] [4] 使用 Pod PromQL 诊断当前资源指标 (内存/C", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789353276738, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_7df035f9be0842f79306ea00", "tool_sequence": 5, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=401 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 2 completed, 1 in progress, 2 pending\n[ ] [4] 使用 Pod PromQL 诊断当前资源指标 (内存/CPU)\n[ ] [5] 分析 Tracing 数据查找 HTTP 500 根因\n[~] [3] 分析容器日志 (当前和 previous) 寻找 OOMKilled/Exit Code 137 证据\n[✓] [1] 获取 Pod 实时状态和资源描述\n[✓] [2] 检查 Liveness Probe 失败详情和 Events\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e37ddc757c53442c-g1/tools/008-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e37ddc757c53442c-g1/tools/008-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/e37ddc757c53442c-g1/tools/008-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

