ing` (#6) 和 `Tracing` (#7) 证实，业务路径 `/work` 在相同时段内持续返回 200 成功状态，且未出现异常。\n3. **非资源限制**：Metric (#5) 显示容器内存使用峰值（~15.4 MiB）远低于 `96 MiB` 的硬限制，确认 Exit 137 是由探针触发而非 OOM。\n\n综上，应用本身未崩溃，但用于健康检查的特定路径（`/health`）未能返回 200，导致 Kubelet 判定健康检查失败并杀死容器。具体是路径不存在、路由未映射、还是健康检查逻辑本身存在缺陷（如依赖的子系统暂不可用），需要进一步比对探针配置与代码逻辑。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 87.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r: 87.7s (Evidence 77.4s, RCA 10.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-48j8r**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 126.084, "metrics": {"run_id": "e37ddc757c53442c", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 126.0892493724823, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 126089.2493724823, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 92018.79286766052, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 14, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 60761.54446601868, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 33571.26593589783}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 24807.615995407104, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 87677.4377822876, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 13575.836658477783, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

